From: Fleurs Nix configuration
Subject: [PATCH] Rebase managed PAM delivery onto oo7 0.7.1

Keep synchronous delivery, a single five-second deadline, daemon UID checks
and the processing acknowledgement required by pam-completion.patch. The
user manager owns daemon startup; do not fork a login helper from PAM.
Retain upstream socket metadata validation on every retry. Decode fallback
PAM_AUTHTOK as a C string, never as the boxed stashed password. Adapt PAM
integration coverage to the acknowledged protocol, including the fallback;
remove obsolete fork/credential-switch implementation tests.

